## Dynamic Marketplace Regulation System

### Objective

Reduce RMT profitability without increasing friction on legitimate players.

### Problem Statement

Current enforcement strategies primarily target supply rather than demand.

### Design Goals

- Reduce illicit profits
- Improve economy stability
- Preserve player freedom
- Maintain progression pacing

### Proposed Solution

Implement dynamic pricing boundaries monitored by market analytics.

### Success Metrics

- Reduced inflation
- Reduced RMT reports
- Improved retention
- Improved marketplace participation

